e.</span></span></h2>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5ydpanm2":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Our Client faced operational inefficiencies due to:</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Data duplication from limited visibility, leading to <span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">overlapping client accounts.</span></span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">System clutter</span></span>, where each truck sale was logged as a separate opportunity.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Manual processes</span></span> for contract generation and TTL, slowing productivity.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Custom access needs</span></span> for sales representatives requiring detailed yet limited views.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5ydpann8":{"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5ydpann8","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"a11y":{"tabindex":"-1"},"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"translations":{"playLabel":"Play","pauseLabel":"Pause"}},"comp-m5ydpano1":{"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5ydpano1","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false}},"comp-m5ydpano8":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5ydpano8","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"columnOverrides":{"width":"100%","contentArea":{"alignment":0.5,"width":360}},"translations":{"ariaLabel":"content changes on hover"}},"comp-m5ydpanp4":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5ydpanp4","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"image":{"hasAnimation":false,"alt":"pexels-cottonbro-5532664 (1).jpg","width":6184,"height":4123,"uri":"6bf859_47acd663f6c342b4819adc4b995bac4c~mv2.jpg","title":"pexels-cottonbro-5532664 (1).jpg","containerId":"comp-m5ydpanp4","hasBgScrollEffect":"","bgEffectName":"","alignType":"center","displayMode":"fill","link":{},"encoding":"AVIF","allowWebpAvifTransforms":true,"containerWidth":620,"containerHeight":362},"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"columnOverrides":{"width":"100%","contentArea":{"alignment":0.5,"width":620}},"translations":{"ariaLabel":"content changes on hover"}},"comp-m5ydpanp14":{"dividers":{"hasTopDivider":false,"hasBottomDivider":false},"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5ydpanp14","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false}},"comp-m5ydpanq3":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5ydpanq3","hasBgFullscreenScrollEffect":false,"shouldRenderUnderlay":true,"shouldPadMedia":false,"hasCanvasAnimation":false},"meshProps":{"wedges":[],"rotatedComponents":[],"fixedComponents":[]},"columnOverrides":{"width":"100%","contentArea":{"alignment":0.5,"width":620}},"translations":{"ariaLabel":"content changes on hover"}},"comp-m5ydpanq10":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:65px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:65px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The Solution</span></span></span></span></p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5ydpanr1":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_0 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:56px; line-height:normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:56px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This is a title.</span></span></h2>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5ydpanr8":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Custom Sharing Rules:</span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Enabled sales reps to view limited details of non-owned accounts to avoid duplication.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Allowed employees to update account ownership on inactive accounts, minimizing conflicts.</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Streamlined Opportunities:</span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Introduced opportunity products under accounts, simplifying the system by consolidating truck sales into unified opportunities.</span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Automated Processes:</span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Automated contract generation and TTL workflows, ensuring each truck sale became an asset automatically.